        </h2>
      </div>
      <button id="close-menu-btn" aria-label="Close menu" style="background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer; color: #1A1A1A; padding: 8px;">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
          <path d="M1 1L19 19M19 1L1 19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        </svg>
